"Max is a lanky, dark-skinned B-rank Adjuster with zonal movement spells."
"His mother is Anesidoran and his father South African; they are divorced."
"He is cutthroat friendly: he baits kill-shots and nudged other B-ranks to quit."
"On his second attempt he was accepted into the CNH hero track."
"He is a month from seventeen, the oldest of his admissions group."
"His copper bracelets cast speed zones and a pool zone that makes air thick as water."
"He noticed Alden shielding with his skill, and Alden owes him a talent use for silence."
